does two things:\r\n\r\n- If subsampled images are enabled, but there is no FDM, we consider that to be one of the \"rendering features\" that will lead to subsampled images getting disabled. This fixes the broken rendering shown on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123406\r\n- If foveation is enabled but the VRS mode isn't set to \"XR\", then give a warning. This is a common mistake, and what was done incorrectly in the MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123406\r\n\r\nWith this PR, here's the warnings I see when running the original MRP:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"986\" height=\"83\" alt=\"Selection_566\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2da5044a-a12a-40ab-b729-2cc837d9155a\" />\r\n\r\nAnd, of course, the rendering is no longer broken :-)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10951989861,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACjMoaZQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.7","name":"cherrypick:4.7","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.7.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url"